-**Inputs:**
-- Set of 3D Gaussians $\{G_i\}_{i=1}^N$ [S1].
-- Training viewpoints $j \in \{1, \dots, V\}$ [S1].
-- Ground truth images $I_j$ and rendered images $\hat{I}_j$ [S1].
-- Growth interval $M$ (number of iterations per growth step) [S1].
-- Parameters: $\tau_{grad}$, $k$, $\lambda$, $\tau_{large}$, $\tau_{SSIM}$ [S1].
-
-**Outputs:**
-- Updated set of 3D Gaussians with grown primitives in identified "hard" regions [S1].
+**Inputs and Outputs:**
+*   **Input:** A set of 3D Gaussians $\{G_i\}$, a set of training viewpoints $J$, ground truth images $\{I_j\}$, and rendered images $\{\hat{I}_j\}$.
+*   **Output:** A subset of "hard Gaussians" identified for densification/growth during the training interval $M$.
 
